{"number":91,"nameArabic":"سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ","nameEnglish":"Ash-Shams","englishMeaning":"The Sun","revelationType":"Meccan","totalVerses":15,"audioUrl":"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/091.mp3","ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"globalNumber":6044,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلشَّمْسِ وَضُحَىٰهَا","translation":"By the sun and its brightness","transliteration":"Wash shamsi wa duhaa haa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6044.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":2,"globalNumber":6045,"arabic":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَىٰهَا","translation":"And [by] the moon when it follows it","transliteration":"Wal qamari izaa talaa haa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6045.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":3,"globalNumber":6046,"arabic":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّىٰهَا","translation":"And [by] the day when it displays it","transliteration":"Wannahaari izaa jallaa haa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6046.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":4,"globalNumber":6047,"arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰهَا","translation":"And [by] the night when it covers it","transliteration":"Wallaili izaa yaghshaa haa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6047.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":5,"globalNumber":6048,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا بَنَىٰهَا","translation":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it","transliteration":"Wassamaaa'i wa maa banaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6048.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":6,"globalNumber":6049,"arabic":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَحَىٰهَا","translation":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it","transliteration":"Wal ardi wa maa tahaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6049.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":7,"globalNumber":6050,"arabic":"وَنَفْسٍۢ وَمَا سَوَّىٰهَا","translation":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it","transliteration":"Wa nafsinw wa maa sawwaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6050.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":8,"globalNumber":6051,"arabic":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","translation":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness,","transliteration":"Fa-alhamahaa fujoorahaa wa taqwaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6051.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":9,"globalNumber":6052,"arabic":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن زَكَّىٰهَا","translation":"He has succeeded who purifies it,","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man zakkaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6052.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":10,"globalNumber":6053,"arabic":"وَقَدْ خَابَ مَن دَسَّىٰهَا","translation":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption].","transliteration":"Wa qad khaaba man dassaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6053.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":11,"globalNumber":6054,"arabic":"كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","translation":"Thamud denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression,","transliteration":"Kazzabat Samoodu bi taghwaahaaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6054.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":12,"globalNumber":6055,"arabic":"إِذِ ٱنۢبَعَثَ أَشْقَىٰهَا","translation":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth.","transliteration":"Izim ba'asa ashqaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6055.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":13,"globalNumber":6056,"arabic":"فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ نَاقَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَسُقْيَٰهَا","translation":"And the messenger of Allah [Salih] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allah or [prevent her from] her drink.\"","transliteration":"Faqaala lahum Rasoolul laahi naaqatal laahi wa suqiyaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6056.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":14,"globalNumber":6057,"arabic":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُم بِذَنۢبِهِمْ فَسَوَّىٰهَا","translation":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them].","transliteration":"Fakazzaboohu fa'aqaroohaa fadamdama 'alaihim Rabbuhum bizambihim fasaw waahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6057.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":15,"globalNumber":6058,"arabic":"وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقْبَٰهَا","translation":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof.","transliteration":"Wa laa yakhaafu'uqbaahaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/6058.mp3"}]}